Package: gnome-calculator
Version: @DEB_GNOME-CALCULATOR_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://apps.gnome.org/Calculator/
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgtk-4-1, libadwaita-1-0, libgtksourceview-5-0, libsoup-3.0-0, libgee-0.8-2, libmpfr6, libmpc3, dbus
Description: GNOME Calculator (GTK4, Vala)
 GNOME Calculator is the GTK4/libadwaita calculator. Written in Vala, the first
 proof of the vendored-.vapi cross-Vala build flow. Runs as a plain X11 client
 under any window manager. (Online currency rates additionally need glib-networking.)
